WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.620
Graduation is highly significant for young people because it is a death and a renewal at the same time

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:10.800
I mean, it's a good way of learning, too,
about life because, you see, when you graduate,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
simultaneously, you have
attained the pinnacle of something.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.700
But by the same token it instantly transforms
you into a beginner at the next stage of your life.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.840
When people say, "What do you want
to be when they grow up in our society"

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.940
they usually mean: "What career are you going to pick?".

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:32.220
It's really not the way the question
should be asked or conceptualized.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.580
You should really think about
what sort of character you want to have.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.880
I would say you should surround yourself

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.480
with people who are aiming up and
who want the best for what's best in you.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.200
Unless you want people that
will excuse your pathologies

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.000
and make way for your weakness
and lead you down the path of perdition.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.720
So you're going to take care of yourself,

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.680
you're going to take care of your family,

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.240
you're going to take care of your community.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.800
You want to grow up and be
a responsible, forthright and honest person.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:02.680
It's the best way through life.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.880
There could be a lot more to you than you know,

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.180
highly probable, and you should act as if there is

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.760
and then you should go out there
and try to do, if not great things,

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:18.720
at least honest, productive,
meaningful, engaged and positive things.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.420
That's what you should be aiming at.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:22.240
There's nothing in that except good.

